---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { route } from '../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../lib/seo';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../data/site-config';
const lang = 'en';
const updated = '2026-10-06';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies on PlantCare101: None, Even in the Plant Tools" description="PlantCare101 sets no cookies and saves no plant settings on your device; Microsoft Clarity runs cookieless only to catch errors in the guides and tools." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: '/' }, { name: 'Cookies', path: route('cookies', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Cookies</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <p>PlantCare101 drops no cookie in your browser: not one of its own, not one from a partner. So there is no pop-up to dismiss before you check whether a pothos is safe for your cat. This page sits alongside the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>The plant tools keep nothing on your device</h2>
    <p>The watering calculator, the pet-safe plant checker, the light finder, the fertilizer dilution calculator and the diagnosis tool run in your browser. The plant, pot size, light, season or symptom you pick stays in the page, and in the address bar when you share a watering result. None of it goes into a cookie, local storage or session storage.</p>
    <h2>Microsoft Clarity without cookies</h2>
    <p>One technical script runs on the guides and tools: Microsoft Clarity, used to find out when something breaks. Before it loads, the page tells it that storage is refused, so it writes no <code>_clck</code> or <code>_clsk</code> cookie and Microsoft sets no <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>. Each page view receives its own short-lived identifier, and visits are never stitched together. Clarity reports script errors, loading times, taps that do nothing and how far a care guide is scrolled; the text of the page and anything you type, such as a plant name in the pet-safe checker, are masked in your browser first.</p>
    <p>Clarity is operated by Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, One Microsoft Place, South County Business Park, Leopardstown, Dublin 18, Ireland. Recordings are kept 30 days, aggregated figures 13 months. Legal basis: our legitimate interest in a site that works (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). To opt out, block clarity.ms in your browser or a content blocker, or write to us; every guide and tool keeps working.</p>
    <h2>The embedded calculator</h2>
    <p>The iframe version of the watering calculator offered to other websites loads no Clarity at all and sets no cookie.</p>
    <h2>What PlantCare101 does not use</h2>
    <p>No audience analytics, no advertising, no social media button. The publisher records no personal data about visitors.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Last updated: {updated}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
